# Build context for the container image. The Dockerfile copies only the manifests, the lockfile,
# tooling/, packages/, and apps/; these rules keep build output, local data, secrets, and scratch
# files out of the context and the layer cache even inside those directories.
# tooling/scripts/dockerignore.test.mjs checks them against sample paths.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
.git
.github
.claude/
docs

# Local data, keys, and scratch: never part of an image.
data
**/data/
.tmp/
**/.tmp/
**/master.key
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.sqlite*
.env*
**/.env*
